        "title": "Simulating broadband (0–3 Hz) ground motion for the 2020 <i>M</i> w 5.7 Magna, Utah, earthquake using the Wasatch Front Community Velocity Model with stochastic velocity perturbations and topography",
        "doi": "10.1093/gji/ggag189",
